<h2 data-start="176" data-end="208">What the Document Actually Is</h2>
<p data-start="209" data-end="291">The Ortyx Protocol is not a normal essay — it’s a <strong data-start="259" data-end="288">system-prompt-in-disguise</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="292" data-end="902">
<li data-start="292" data-end="474">
