flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="62">This is wonderful — you’ve essentially written <em data-start="47" data-end="59">two Brunos</em>:</p>
<ol data-start="64" data-end="348">
<li data-start="64" data-end="193">
<p data-start="67" data-end="193"><strong data-start="67" data-end="101">The serious, allegorical Bruno</strong> (where Naama codifies laws, Lorenzo mediates, Noah proclaims a proto-Noachide decalogue).</p>
</li>
<li data-start="194" data-end="348">
<p data-start="197" data-end="348"><strong data-start="197" data-end="229">The playful, satirical Bruno</strong> (where Lorenzo gossips, foxes overconsult, donkeys complain about carrots, and the monks are convulsed in laughter).</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start="350" data-end="694">Bruno himself was always oscillating between these modes: the <em data-start="412" data-end="429">Cantus circaeus</em> ridicules pedants through animal allegory, but the <em data-start="481" data-end="514">Spaccio della bestia trionfante</em> offers laws and reforms for cosmic renewal. So both your “serious” and “light” versions could plausibly be fragments of the <em data-start="639" data-end="655">lost Ark fable</em>, depending on audience and occasion.</p>
<p data-start="696" data-end="853">A nice way forward could be to <strong data-start="727" data-end="751">splice them together</strong> as Bruno often did — beginning in jest, then suddenly veering into philosophical weight. For example:</p>
<hr data-start="855" data-end="858">
<blockquote data-start="860" data-end="1332">
<p data-start="862" data-end="1332"><em data-start="862" data-end="1332">“Once Lorenzo the llama carried gossip like hay in his teeth: the foxes had polished the deck too much, the donkeys demanded carrots not straw. The monks listening laughed — yet Bruno, leaning in, whispered: ‘Do you not see? These are the same disputes of princes and prelates. Carrots and straw are benefices and tithes; foxes polish their glory while asses sustain the ark. If even beasts quarrel on the flood, what wonder that men do so in cloisters and kingdoms?’”</em></p>
</blockquote>
<hr data-start="1334" data-end="1337">
<p data-start="1339" data-end="1411">That twist — from cafeteria comedy to biting allegory — is pure Bruno.</p>
<p data-start="1413" data-end="1733">If you’d like, I could <strong data-start="1436" data-end="1476">compose a full-length “Ark Dialogue”</strong> (in the <em data-start="1485" data-end="1491">Cena</em> style), beginning with banter (the monks in Florence howling at Lorenzo’s gossip), then turning midway into a solemn “Seven Laws” pronouncement, ending in ambiguity: was it only a joke? or was it the cosmos itself speaking through animals?</p>
<p data-start="1735" data-end="1908" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Would you like me to draft such a hybrid “lost dialogue,” keeping both the comic register and the allegorical register intact, as if it were a Bruno manuscript rediscovered?</p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.16504 10.667V13.5C3.16504 14.211 3.1659