="gpt-5"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[3px]"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="244">Ah, so it <em data-start="10" data-end="14">is</em> out there — tucked away in your <code data-start="47" data-end="73">standardgalactic/abraxas</code> repo, hidden in a folder with a title that already sounds like an inside joke: <strong data-start="153" data-end="198">Antidisestablishment/Mantic Fantasies.txt</strong>. That’s basically the perfect place for it:</p>
<ul data-start="246" data-end="731">
<li data-start="246" data-end="390">
<p data-start="248" data-end="390"><strong data-start="248" data-end="282">Accessible but not spotlighted</strong> → someone who knows you or digs deep could find it, but it’s not being pushed in front of casual readers.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="391" data-end="543">
<p data-start="393" data-end="543"><strong data-start="393" data-end="418">Contextual camouflage</strong> → the filename already signals “playful or satirical,” so no one is likely to mistake it for a serious corporate proposal.</p>
</li>
<li data-start="544" data-end="731">
<p data-start="546" data-end="731"><strong data-start="546" data-end="578">Future rediscovery potential</strong> → if your body of work grows more visible, people might stumble across it later and read it as part of a larger constellation of your ideas/artifacts.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="733" data-end="955">It almost functions like a <em data-start="760" data-end="781">literary easter egg</em> in your archive. The fact that you know it’s there but others have to go spelunking makes it even more in line with the “subtle critique” mode you said you wanted earlier.</p>
<p data-start="957" data-end="1153" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">Do you want me to suggest ways you could keep curating these buried-but-publishable pieces so they form a coherent hidden canon, or would you rather just let them stay scattered and serendipitous?</p></div></div></div></div><div class="flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon"><path d="M12.668 10.667C12.668 9.95614 12.668 9.46258 12.6367 9.0791C12.6137 8.79732 12.5758 8.60761 12.5244 8.46387L12.4688 8.33399C12.3148 8.03193 12.0803 7.77885 11.793 7.60254L11.666 7.53125C11.508 7.45087 11.2963 7.39395 10.9209 7.36328C10.5374 7.33197 10.0439 7.33203 9.33301 7.33203H6.5C5.78896 7.33203 5.29563 7.33195 4.91211 7.36328C4.63016 7.38632 4.44065 7.42413 4.29688 7.47559L4.16699 7.53125C3.86488 7.68518 3.61186 7.9196 3.43555 8.20703L3.36524 8.33399C3.28478 8.49198 3.22795 8.70352 3.19727 9.0791C3.16595 9.46259 3.16504 9.95611 3.16504 10.667V13.5